  "design": [
    "Complete the back image before scheduling its display. Swap only at a fresh VSync and at least two retraces after the preceding physical swap. Reuse command storage only after GPU completion.",
    "Run game/audio updates from elapsed VSync ticks, including catch-up after a slow render. Finish catch-up before building the next image; do not queue an obsolete simulation state or add the old alternating idle wait.",
    "Allow static command capture once the camera actually reaches its full XYZ target. Retain exact camera/entity keys, movement invalidation and the existing UI/input settle delay. Opening sweeps and active combat/return transitions still opt out.",
    "Count missed display retraces from actual swaps. Do not reset the last physical swap timestamp when resetting an observation window or printing telemetry. No gameplay rules, scenarios, command counts, asset quality, memory reserves or test thresholds changed."
  ],
