  "limits": [
    "One cold five-VI return frame remains per observed attack/ability close view. Heavy keep overview/scrolling still exceeds30FPS; strict gates remain failures.",
    "Elapsed-time updates prevent slowdown under load, but missed presentation frames remain visible. Emulator measurements do not establish hardware performance.",
    "The campaign driver freshness fix is a separate commit; it waits for a new real UI observation after each input, without changing the route or pass criteria.",
    "Keep callback-cycle jitter prevents the strict constant-rate encoder from accepting those captures. Raw images/timestamps and display-origin transitions are retained; no misleading fixed-rate keep movie is published."
  ],
